  },
  "description_short": "Elastic (NYSE: ESTC) integrates its deep expertise in search technology with artificial intelligence to help everyone transform all of their data into answers, actions, and outcomes. Elasticsearch, which is the foundation for its search, observability, and security solutions, is used by thousands of companies, including more than 75% of the Fortune 100. Learn more at elastic.co.",
